<title>UK: Key economic forecasts from last UK budget.</title>
<headline>Key economic forecasts from last UK budget.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the key short-term economic forecasts from the 1997/98 budget presented by Conservative Chancellor of the Exchequer Kenneth Clarke on November 26, 1996.</p>
<p>The present Chancellor, Gordon Brown, will present his first budget at 1430 GMT on July 2.</p>
<p>Brown asked the National Audit Office to review the economic assumptions on which public finances are based.</p>
<p>Following are Clarke's forecasts (percentage changes on a year earlier unless otherwise stated):</p>
